     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<div><br></div><div>I have a Shinydashboard app consisting of a few pages &quot;pages&quot; some with several tabs in a tabSetPanel.  I use the updateTabsetPanel function to refresh the tabs when a new data source is selected by the user on a home page. Some tabs are hidden depending on the dataset chosen as the information they contain is irrelevant to that data source.</div><div><span style=\"text-align:center\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"text-align:center\">One thing I have noticed is that on the pages with tabSetPanel there is a tab number displayed such as tab-9653-3 (see attached screenshots below). This number is different for each tabsetPanel. How can this be removed or hidden.</span></div><div><br></div><div>Andrew</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pNrPkDj0cD4/WzXnLiT_hyI/AAAAAAAAIsE/1TPGSt_SSo8bSMMtwC7uuIStx1B7QPBiwCLcBGAs/s1600/Capture1.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pNrPkDj0cD4/WzXnLiT_hyI/AAAAAAAAIsE/1TPGSt_SSo8bSMMtwC7uuIStx1B7QPBiwCLcBGAs/s1600/Capture1.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792387975104000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0l2WHQCFEPPd9eFij9yWPx\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pNrPkDj0cD4/WzXnLiT_hyI/AAAAAAAAIsE/1TPGSt_SSo8bSMMtwC7uuIStx1B7QPBiwCLcBGAs/s200/Capture1.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"153\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w07u6wVd2sw/WzXnSedv7MI/AAAAAAAAIsI/Dd7baaRtwl4GOJlLikHYoh9u2PgyVKilwCLcBGAs/s1600/Capture3.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel